           <property name="whatsThis">
            <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;The conditions that an ObjectReference must match in order to fill a &amp;quot;Find Matching Reference&amp;quot; alias. In most cases, the Subject is whatever the alias is about to be filled with; however, the &amp;quot;Unique Actor,&amp;quot; &amp;quot;Location Alias Reference,&amp;quot; and &amp;quot;Create Reference&amp;quot; fill types treat the player-character as the Subject, because there are no loaded references available to test.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
        </layout>
       </item>
