          <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Another Reference Alias on this Quest. The new ObjectReference will be spawned at that alias's ObjectReference. You can only specify a &amp;quot;sibling&amp;quot; alias that fills before this alias (i.e. one with a lower ID number, appearing higher in the alias list).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
         </property>
